{
	"_comment": "The Guild's social simulation (MemoryManager.gd; docs/design/LIVING_WORLD.md sections A, B, G). Memories are what an adventurer (or you) remembers about someone: weight > 0 good, < 0 bad. They fade daily unless core; the same kind about the same person adds up (to the kind's cap). Gossip copies strong memories to listeners at a fraction of their weight.",
